            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Elisa oona ũu, na ookĩlya wasya, Asa wakwa, asa wakwa, makasya ma Isilaeli na ala matũlaa mbalasi syamo! Na ndaamwona ĩngĩ: na akwata ngũa syake mwene, na aitembũan’ya ilungu ilĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
